Third-party data
----------------

Parts of this repository are derived from Questie / QuestieDB data:

  Questie and QuestieDB
  https://github.com/Questie/Questie
  https://github.com/Questie/QuestieDB
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPLv3).

Derived files:

  DruidKit/DruidKit_DungeonData.lua  Generated by tools/dungeon_data.py from QuestieDB's WoW Forever quest, NPC and
                                     quest XP data (quest levels, XP, givers and their spots, prerequisites).
  planner/travel.json                Town spots (zone, x, y) taken from QuestieDB NPC spawns.

The QuestieDB data itself (planner/db.json, planner/data/) is built locally by planner/load_db.py and is not
committed.

